-- L13-A1-character-facts.sql (lots A1 and A2, 2026-11-03; generated by scripts/anime/a2/gen-l13.mjs, do not edit by hand)
--
-- What:   the Otakudle facts of docs/o1/contracts/dle-a1-characters.md for the whole pool: 50 series_facts rows (demographic) and 750 character_facts rows (the 750 characters
--         of data/all-series.json that L04 has), with 4931 entity_sources rows (one per stored value and supporting source: Wikidata, Wikipedia or a Fandom wiki). Upserts only. It touches no other
--         table, no row of L01 to L12, no kpop row. A1's 120 characters were the first version of this file; A1's values are among the sources of these (a1_facts),
--         after the owner's rulings of 2026-11-03 (Denji is a devil-human-hybrid, for one). The 20 characters of A1 that the pool does not hold are no longer in the game.
--         featured: the 200 characters of TOP200.md, the only ones the first bank of otakudle draws its target from (023); 598 characters have a gender, a species,
--         a role and a voice actor, 185 of them are featured.
--         Sources: 269 roles at the first appearance are the role of the site data itself (characters.role, K1), with no entity_sources row; 5 values rest on an
--         ORCH ruling of 2026-11-03 and carry the pages read for the character as their sources.
--         Waiting for L04 (not in the file, listed): none
-- Needs:  L04 (series and characters), 011 (entity_sources.source_url and the source fandom), 023 (the two tables and featured).
-- Verify: docs/launch/o1/checks/V-L13.sql (session.sh J4); select count(*) from public.series_facts;   expect 50
--         select count(*) from public.character_facts;   expect 750
-- Undo:   L13-A1-character-facts.rollback.sql (refused once the game otakudle has a play).
-- o1-transaction: single (psql --single-transaction). Idempotent: a second run changes nothing.

